<title>USA: National Surgery buys Florida center.</title>
<headline>National Surgery buys Florida center.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Surgery Centers Inc said it acquired Day Surgery Center in Port St. Lucie, Fla., from a group of physicians made up primarily of ophthalmologists.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>National Surgery has a network of 32 outpatient centers in 13 states.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
